{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14967","headline":"同赵进马元阳春日登长春宫古城望河中因寄郑损仓曹 · 卢纶","name":"同赵进马元阳春日登长春宫古城望河中因寄郑损仓曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城头春霭晓蒙蒙，指望关桥满袖风。\n云骑闲嘶宫柳外，玉人愁立草花中。\n钟分寺路山光绿，河绕军州日气红。\n迹忝已成方恋赏，此时离恨与君同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}